        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": null,
          "expr": "slo:vllm_ttft_burn_rate:6h",
          "legendFormat": "6h burn rate"
        }
      ],
      "description": "How fast the TTFT error budget is being spent compared to steady-state. 14.4 (red line) = 2% of monthly budget consumed in 1h (fast-burn alert threshold). 6 (orange line) = 5% in 6h (slow-burn). 1 = at steady-state - budget exactly spent over 30d."
    },
